second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What sport is Larry Gilbert associated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"sport\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 10, \"text\": \"Tennessee.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d00\", \"start\": 11, \"end\": 80, \"text\": \"He won the PGA Club Professional Championship in 1981, 1982 and 1991.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d00\", \"start\": 81, \"end\": 201, \"text\": \"He also won ten Kentucky PGA Championships, three Kentucky Opens, one Tennessee Open and one Tennessee PGA Championship.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d00\", \"start\": 202, \"end\": 352, \"text\": \"Gilbert was inducted into the Kentucky Golf Hall of Fame in 1992; he is also a member of the Middle Tennessee State University Athletics Hall of Fame.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d00\", \"start\": 353, \"end\": 443, \"text\": \"He joined the Senior PGA Tour (later known as the Champions Tour) upon turning 50 in 1992.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d00\", \"start\": 444, \"end\": 512, \"text\": \"Gilbert died in Lexington, Kentucky of lung cancer at the age of 55.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d00\", \"start\": 513, \"end\": 577, \"text\": \"He had started smoking cigarettes at an early age, and was often\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 192, \"text\": \"Larry Gilbert (baseball) Lawrence William Gilbert (December 3, 1891 – February 17, 1965) was an American right fielder in Major League Baseball and a longtime manager in minor league baseball.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d01\", \"start\": 193, \"end\": 355, \"text\": \"A native of New Orleans, Louisiana, who broke into baseball as a left-handed pitcher, Gilbert first became famous as a member of the 1914 \\\"Miracle\\\" Boston Braves.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d01\", \"start\": 356, \"end\": 458, \"text\": \"But his Major League career lasted only two seasons (the Braves' breakthrough 1914 campaign and 1915).\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d01\", \"start\": 459, \"end\": 568, \"text\": \"A left-handed batter, he batted .230 with five homers, 29 runs batted in, ten doubles and seven stolen bases.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d01\", \"start\": 569, \"end\": 601, \"text\": \"In , Gilbert was a member of the\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 99, \"text\": \"Tweet Reddit WhatsApp Email More Share on Tumblr Pocket Telegram Mastodon Nextdoor Like Loading ...\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d02\", \"start\": 100, \"end\": 319, \"text\": \"Posted in Grave Story Boston Braves Larry Gilbert Minor Leagues Nashville Volunteers New Orleans New Orleans Pelicans Published by Sam Gazdziak I am a professional journalist , baseball historian and cemetery searcher .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d02\", \"start\": 320, \"end\": 355, \"text\": \"My family tolerates this about me .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0292-6bab6a7ad6da:d02\", \"start\": 356, \"end\": 421, \"text\": \"I belong to the Society for American Baseball Research ( SABR ) .\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"